<?xml version="1.0" standalone="yes"?>
<!--
    FalaDan's Sparkle feed. Empty on purpose: no FalaDan release has been
    published.

    This file previously held upstream MiniWhisper's three releases — their
    titles, their github.com/andyhtran/MiniWhisper download URLs, and their
    Ed25519 signatures. Once Scripts/build-app.sh was repointed at this repo's
    feed, a signed release build would have offered somebody else's binary as a
    FalaDan update. `generate_appcast` also preserves existing items, so they
    would have been carried forward into the first real release.

    Before publishing anything, generate a signing keypair of your own:

        generate_keys     # from sparkle-tools

    and put the printed public key in version.env as SU_PUBLIC_ED_KEY. It
    currently holds upstream's, which means this app trusts their key and not
    yours — you cannot sign an update it would accept, and they can.
-->
<rss xmlns:sparkle="http://www.andymatuschak.org/xml-namespaces/sparkle" version="2.0">
    <channel>
        <title>FalaDan</title>
    </channel>
</rss>
